  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Knowledge of the ability of the soil to mineralize nitrogen (N) and release greenhouse gases (GHG) at the landscape scale is critical to predict and model future effects of climate change on Arctic soil organic matter (SOM). The objective was to examine how SOM characteristics influences soil gross nitrogen mineralization and soil carbon dynamics in several Arctic ecosystems."
